37747>>>>>    Procedure SetActionButtons
37750>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
37750>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
37750>>>>>        Boolean bHasRecord
37750>>>>>        Handle hoDD
37750>>>>>
37750>>>>>        Get Server to hoDD
37751>>>>>        Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
37752>>>>>        Get HasRecord of hoDD to bHasRecord
37753>>>>>
37753>>>>>        // let's hide all buttons and then Show the ones we want
37753>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to False
37754>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to False
37755>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to False
37756>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to False
